[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n2_godric"
text = "# DRAFT
# Abbot Godric in the chapter house at dusk (night 2). Uneasy: he believes a demon troubles the house, but hasn't said so
# to the chapter yet (he will at dawn, and order more incense). He dreams badly: the drug, though he doesn't know it.
# He tells the porter to count every brother at Matins tonight, and to breathe the incense.
== start
(The abbot sits with his blanket in the chapter house, but he isn't reading. He's watching the door.)
Godric: Brother Alric. Come in, come in, and shut the door against the draught.
-> dead [if died_merchant]
-> whole

== dead
Godric: A guest of ours died in the night, in the water. I've said a mass for him, and I'll say another.
-> topics

== whole
Godric: Your first night passed, and you're whole. Thank God for that.
-> topics

== again
Godric: You're still here, child? Good. I'd rather not sit alone tonight.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n2_godric_demon] What troubles you, Father Abbot? -> demon
* [if n1_knock_no_one] [if not n2_godric_knock] Last night there was a knock at the gate, and no one there. -> knock
* [if not n2_godric_counsel] What would you have me do tonight, Father Abbot? -> counsel

== demon [set n2_godric_demon]
Godric: Something has come into this house, brother. I feel it when I pray, like a draught from a door nobody opened.
Godric: I think it's a demon. I've not said so to the chapter. I'll not say it till I'm sure.
Godric: Last night I dreamed something knelt at the foot of my bed and counted on its fingers.
-> topics

== knock [set n2_godric_knock]
(He crosses himself.)
Godric: And no one there. If it comes again, don't open to it. Ring the bell and wake me.
-> topics

== counsel [set n2_godric_counsel]
Godric: Keep the gate. Count us at Matins, every one, and come to me if one is missing.
Godric: And breathe the incense, child. That's what it's for. I mean to have Ranulf burn more.
-> topics

== leave
Godric: Count us all, brother. Every one.
"
